{"id":1700,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为进一步激发学生创新热情，提升实践创新能力，4 月 7 日，学院联合学院科学技术协会、创新实验室开展学生交流活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uL49UYn7-iM8lYUnzAkMmMRL7UZL4lSZM7MVnzCYLz7bUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0oShfnkh2L1hknR9PLR6kUNQVLRLPMmW2Mm74nzUYLlMkL4rFolrRMR6RnlMFMl7PnRNJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0LmLaLRlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=23005&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9ADF2BD8107BBFE03162F613E421CB35/9EC47CEC/5A1D9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLR-U4LzWfLRl8Ln4CPMRVfnR9aU46S2o7lbMmA2LRVkUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPUShfnSyYLzGiUzUbUN-DMNL8MlVfM4N8nm6VMzvZL46FMlWfnzGsL7nFMl7YnR7PgtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4LRGigtA8pUzcc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=23005&e=.jpg\"></p><p>副院长李晓出席并强调实验室安全管理工作，要求同学们增强安全意识，爱护实验环境，共同做好实验室日常管理与维护。各创新实验室负责人依次介绍团队成员、研究方向、项目开展及获奖成果。随后，师生围绕学科竞赛、科研训练、科创实践等内容深入交流探讨。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUlnUfLNV2L8L8nnllaMmWkLRlPozNSsMNnVM4LPUNVkUm-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybokyPMSysoRUbMz7iUzr2LzUPnR9aM494ozVfLlCDMmQFM4VVMmv4L8rFMl7PoRvJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0LmLaLRlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=23005&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/598157849515A5F141D8078391A1F666/71E6733E/5A187\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uU49UPLRrVL4Q2onR9DM7nVUznkL4NSPMNlbMRQ7UNWVLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy4okyYokyZUm7YMNUanlMRMmC8nRLboR62L8V2UzUYL8MFo7nkMmrVozTFMzQ2oR9agtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-4LRGigtA8pUzcc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=23005&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次活动有效搭建了交流学习平台，拓宽了学生科研视野，进一步提升了学生创新意识与实践能力，为学院培育高素质创新型人才夯实了基础。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ece.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uL49UYn7-iM8lYUnzAkMmMRL7UZL4lSZM7MVnzCYLz7bUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0oShfnkh2L1hknR9PLR6kUNQVLRLPMmW2Mm74nzUYLlMkL4rFolrRMR6RnlMFMl7PnRNJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0LmLaLRlJqdznx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=23005&e=.jpg"}